  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="d5a76d94-cf2d-48b0-bf90-ab0135ae6830"><problem><para>
      <para> Evaluate \(\frac{140-20}{9-12}\) mentally. </para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>-40</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is -40. </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
